        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Bungarten, Andrés Segovia\n- Events: Guitar Competition of Granada, concert tour of Spain\n- Places: Granada, Spain, Linares\n- Roles: virtuoso guitarist, classical guitarist, 1st Marquis of Salobreña\n\nFacts:\n- Andrés Segovia Torres, 1st Marquis of Salobreña, was born on 21 February 1893 in Linares, Spain.\n- Andrés Segovia was a virtuoso Spanish classical guitarist.\n- In 1981, Frank Bungarten gained notice in the international guitar scene when Andrés Segovia awarded him first prize at the Guitar Competition of Granada.\n- Frank Bungarten's prize at the Guitar Competition of Granada included an extensive concert tour of Spain.\n- Andrés Segovia died on 2 June 1987.",
